# Bounty Description
bounty-description-treasure-datadisk-encrypted = We need you to find encrypted datadisks and return them to us so we can ascertain their secrets. They can sometimes be found on debris.
bounty-description-meat-carp-fillet = We need you to get a sample of some carp meat. You can find these from butchering Space Carp or their more agressive bretheren Sharkminnows.
bounty-description-treasure-sample-tube = Our xenobiologists need you to secure intact abandoned samples for study and safety. They can sometimes be found on debris.
bounty-description-treasure-cpu-supercharged = We need you to secure these advanced alien computing components so we can study them to see if we can improve our own manufacturing. They can sometimes be found on debris.
bounty-description-ore-geode = We are performing a geological survey on the asteroids near your station. Get us a wide range of samples of Geodes mined from rock which isn't saturated with any specific ore.
bounty-description-goliathmeat = We need you to get a couple slabs of Goliath meat. It doesn't matter if it rots. These guys are pretty slow, but be careful about the tentacles: they'll grab you and pull you to the ground. You don't want to know what happens next.
